+    /// A window asked to be minimized (`xdg_toplevel.set_minimized`).
+    ///
+    /// niri has no minimized state and leaves the window where it is; a desktop shell listening
+    /// on the event stream decides what minimizing means, for example moving the window to a
+    /// hidden workspace. This event is not part of the replicated state: it is only sent to
+    /// clients connected when the request arrives. (Lulo OS patch.)
+    WindowMinimizeRequested {
+        /// Id of the window.
+        id: u64,
+    },
 }
 
